{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/324173-bolthole-metaphysics","id":324173,"title":"Bolthole metaphysics","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-11-27T20:37:29-08:00","id":324173,"title":"Bolthole metaphysics","content":"A bolt hole exists outside of 3d space but does that mean it can or cannot be reflected within the shadow? If such an anomaly could be reflected in the shadow the area outside its reflection may not exist in the sense of connecting it to another place in the shadow or it could simply lead to its currently linked location's reflection. The real reason I wonder this bizarre question is, what if resonance builds within a bolthole - can it even build up within a bolthole and if it can how would demons use this knowledge. <br /> <br /> So my question boils down to 1) what do you think about the possibility and 2) if it was included in your game what would you as a demon do with such knowledge, even if just dismiss it as irrelevant.<br /> <br /> With my current Demon concept I would, if I discovered such attempt build a specific resonance and begin to explore the possibility of using it to covertly try to construct independent infrastructure or at least grasp the concepts - but that is just an extremely long term goal the concept has.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-01T19:32:40-08:00","id":327577,"title":"","content":"A bolthole is a place outside of space and time. It is a glitch in the God-Machine's structure, an unobtrusive place that technically doesn't exist at all. There is only Twilight, which can be removed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2861-nyx","name":"Nyx","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2861_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-01T21:01:05-08:00","id":327665,"title":"","content":"Alright well let me put the question more in the context i intended. 'What if'. For instance what if a demon used rip the gates(to go to the shadow) within a bolthole, what would happen? a) pop into the shadow where it links to the entrance b) chaos c) bizarre and impossible reflection of bolthole etc. There a plenty of ways an st could handle the situation I describe but on the off chance they went with option c what if one was to follow that train of logic is the basis of my entail post. Not a request for raw but a pondering of the implications of but one improbable result.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-01T21:15:02-08:00","id":327674,"title":"","content":"You're going from a place that doesn't exist into the Shadow.<br /> <br /> I'm not even sure you <i>can</i> use Rip The Gates in your bolthole, isolated piss hole of the universe as it is.<br /> <br /> But I like to assume things that happen, and say that it might open up either to someplace that represents the non-existant nature of the place, or to a place that mirror's closest associations(So the bolthole in FoH's opening might lead to, I dunno, the Library of Alexandria's Shadow)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-01T21:19:25-08:00","id":327676,"title":"","content":"In my game, it would fail. My perspective would be that you have to be somewhere in the world to travel to a reflection of it.<br /> <br /> If we assume its option C, I would guess that it would end up in some strange Shadow portion of the God-Machine. I mean if it has a Shadow reflection it would then just begin to function like any other place with a Shadow hold over. Resonance, spirits, and anything else that goes with having a Shadow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2861-nyx","name":"Nyx","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2861_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-01T22:05:02-08:00","id":327714,"title":"","content":"I will admit the thought is in part inspired by &quot;places that cannot be&quot; aspect of the shadow. I am going to try it but honestly I can see my St going with a black hole else result so just pondering.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}